{"title": "Mind Flayer Brain", "pageid": 12917, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Brain", "categories": ["Bugs", "Consumables", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Elder_Brain\" title=\"Elder Brain\">Elder Brain</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Mind Flayer Brain controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/0/0d/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Unfaded.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Mind Flayer Brain</span></a> is a story item in Baldur's Gate 3.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This sticky, greying mass exudes a slightly sweet, putrid odour.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Consumables\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumables</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Devouring_Brain\"> Condition: Devouring Brain </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devouring_Brain_(Condition)\" title=\"Devouring Brain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devouring Brain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devouring_Brain_(Condition)\" title=\"Devouring Brain (Condition)\">Devouring Brain</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The starving illithid is fully focused on eating its first brain in an age.</li>\n<li>Consuming the brain provides the equivalent of one <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Part of the newborn <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(windmill)\" title=\"Mind flayer (windmill)\">Mind Flayer</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Windmill_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Windmill Basement\">Windmill Basement</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Consuming this has the same effect as consuming a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/20px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/30px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/40px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/20px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> in granting the ability to choose a new power from <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">Illithid powers</a>. However, consuming it after having fed the newborn mind flayer does not grant the bonus, triggering the message: <i>\"It's no good - it won't be any use now. It's overripend thanks to your feeding.\"</i></li>\n<li>Despite the action of consuming carrying the name of the character actually eating the brain, the effect is to add one point to the communal powers pool and so anyone in the party can use the point, not just the consumer.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In what may be an oversight, this brain has no effect if eaten by a character who has not consumed any Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen before.</li>\n<li>The animation on spending the point shows a tadpole instead of a brain.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201453\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1923/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20651/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6349/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933023/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.507      1 -total\n 98.16%   42.707      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n 23.38%   10.172      6 Template:Icon_text\n 20.22%    8.799     21 Template:Trim\n 15.68%    6.823      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 15.38%    6.690      1 Template:Condition\n 14.19%    6.173      2 Template:Main_only\n 12.68%    5.516      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.38%    5.388      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.24%    5.324      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12917-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201453 and revision id 396177. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}